5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I'm not really sure what to do first. Maybe we should just... be careful?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,A cautious start is expected. I suggest we observe the speaking patterns of everyone. The wolf will likely try to blend in or lead too aggressively.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I agree with Shion, though I doubt any of us are that obvious. Let's just keep it civil and see who cracks first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I hope we can find a way to work together harmoniously, even in a game like this.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,I shall take a step back and observe. Experience tells me that the truth often reveals itself to those who listen more than they speak.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, you seem very confident... I hope I can be as helpful as you.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Confidence is merely a tool, Daisuke. @George, your silence is noted. Are you planning to remain a spectator throughout the game?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Let him be, Shion. Not everyone feels the need to dominate the conversation. I'm more interested in who is trying too hard to be ""kind.""","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, is kindness a suspicious trait? I just want us all to feel comfortable while we solve this mystery.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"I am not a spectator, Shion. I am simply analyzing. I believe we should focus on the Seer's upcoming information tomorrow.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with George. The Seer's help will be important.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,Indeed. The Seer is our only objective source of truth. I wonder if the Seer will be bold enough to reveal themselves early.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,Revealing yourself early is a death sentence. A rational Seer will wait until they have a target worth naming.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,That makes sense. We should protect the Seer if they decide to trust us with their findings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,Precisely. Safety and timing are everything in this dance of deception.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think I'm okay for now.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
