36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Good morning... did anyone... find anything out?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The time for the Seer to speak has come. If you have a result, now is the most efficient time to share it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm curious to see if anyone is brave enough to claim the role. Or perhaps the wolf will fake it first?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I hope the Seer found something that helps us stay together. Please, share only if you feel safe.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,George,,I have a result. I will state it clearly: Shunichi is the werewolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@George... really? Shunichi is the wolf? That's... shocking.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shion,,A direct claim on the first day. Either George is a very brave Seer or a very reckless werewolf trying to frame Shunichi.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Ha! That's a bold move, George. I'm flattered you're so focused on me, but you're lying. I am a simple villager.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is a very difficult start. George seems so reliable, but Shunichi is so calm.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,George,,"My divination is absolute. I have no reason to lie, as doing so would only make me a target.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to believe George. He seems honest.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shunichi, your defense is generic. ""I am a simple villager"" is the standard script. Give us a logical reason why George would target you.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Because I'm the most capable person here, Shion. The wolf would want to remove the strongest logical mind first. George is just playing that hand.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"It's so sad to see us arguing already. But if George is the Seer, we must listen to him.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,George,,I have provided the truth. The rest is up to the village's judgment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for Shunichi.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
